{start_of_verse: PC1}
{x_bars: 4}
[G]Ea me fa destirare
[G]vardare [Bb]par [G]su
[G]Noea pensa, noea vede
[G]Noea scolta, [Bb]noea [G]crede
[G]No a conta mai giusta
[G]ea me fa con[Bb]fu[G]sion
[G]eà me voe soeo
[G]pa’ on toco [Bb]de [G]pan
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: V2}
{x_bars: 8}
[G]l’Anguana xe bea
[G]l’Anguana me piaxe
[Bb]l’Anguana fa mae
[G]l’Anguana spaura
[G]l’Anguana me istiga
[G]l’Anguana xe spoja
[Bb]l’Anguana xe nuda
[G]l’Anguana fa voja
{end_of_verse}

